"Ove opcije vam omogućavaju da modificirate kako je prognoza proračunata."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: details-settings.docbook:396
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show account limit information"
msgstr "Prikaži informacije o limitu računa"

#. Tag: para
#: details-settings.docbook:398
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displays the account limit as set in the Account Edit dialog. It affects any "
"list which includes Payment accounts."
